00:21:21.730 --> 00:21:25.740
So what we're doing is that,
in our preprocessing in pandas,

00:21:25.740 --> 00:21:28.740
we make sure that the weight
in pounds is greater than 0,

00:21:28.740 --> 00:21:30.540
that the mother's age
is greater than 0,

00:21:30.540 --> 00:21:32.850
that the gestation
weeks is greater than 0,

00:21:32.850 --> 00:21:34.890
and the plurality
is greater than 0.

00:21:34.890 --> 00:21:36.780
So we are just
filtering the data

00:21:36.780 --> 00:21:39.930
to make sure that we are only
dealing with valid data sets.

00:21:39.930 --> 00:21:42.330
And then, remember
what we talked about,

00:21:42.330 --> 00:21:45.160
that sometimes you know it
and sometimes you don't.

00:21:45.160 --> 00:21:46.830
So here's how we're
dealing with it.

00:21:46.830 --> 00:21:49.890
We're basically taking the
numbers 1, 2, 3, 4, and 5,

00:21:49.890 --> 00:21:53.740
and replacing them with single,
twins, triplets, et cetera.

00:21:53.740 --> 00:21:56.640
And we are basically
going to simulate

00:21:56.640 --> 00:21:58.150
the lack of an ultrasound.

00:21:58.150 --> 00:22:03.060
So for every row in our input
data, we create one more row.

00:22:03.060 --> 00:22:07.260
And the second row is going
to be a copy of the first row,

00:22:07.260 --> 00:22:11.820
except the plurality is only
going to be single or multiple,

00:22:11.820 --> 00:22:14.490
the idea being that we don't
know if it's twins or triplets,

00:22:14.490 --> 00:22:17.010
but we do know if it's
one kid or two kids.

00:22:17.010 --> 00:22:20.070
And the gender of the baby
is going to be unknown.

00:22:20.070 --> 00:22:23.490
So now, the gender of the baby
can be three possible values,

00:22:23.490 --> 00:22:25.470
male, female, or unknown.

00:22:25.470 --> 00:22:29.700
And the plurality can be single,
twins, triplets, quadruplets,

00:22:29.700 --> 00:22:33.390
quintuplets, but
also multiple plus.

00:22:33.390 --> 00:22:36.390
So that's the basic thing
that appear in our data.

00:22:36.390 --> 00:22:38.670
And we create that
pandas data frame

00:22:38.670 --> 00:22:43.050
and we basically go ahead
